            0.315,
            0.201,
            0.443,
            0.235
          ],
          "content": "How many entries do we have to look at?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.334,
            0.255,
            0.422,
            0.274
          ],
          "content": "All of them!"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.652,
            0.124,
            0.771,
            0.143
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Binary Search"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.749,
            0.201,
            0.855,
            0.235
          ],
          "content": "Requires that the data is sorted!"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.745,
            0.255,
            0.859,
            0.273
          ],
          "content": "But few checks!"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.196,
            0.406,
            0.379,
            0.425
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "The Sorting Challenge"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.435,
            0.304,
            0.452
          ],
          "content": "• **Given:** A list of numbers"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.455,
            0.38,
            0.471
          ],
          "content": "• **Goal:** Sort those numbers using only"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.473,
            0.356,
            0.488
          ],
          "content": "§ Iteration (while-loops or for-loops)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.135,
            0.489,
            0.279,
            0.505
          ],
          "content": "§ Comparisons (< or >)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.135,
            0.505,
            0.288,
            0.52
          ],
          "content": "§ Assignment statements"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.522,
            0.314,
            0.538
          ],
          "content": "• Why? For proper **analysis**."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.539,
            0.399,
            0.554
          ],
          "content": "§ Methods/functions come with hidden costs"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.135,
            0.555,
            0.372,
            0.571
          ],
          "content": "§ Everything above has no hidden costs"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.571,
            0.399,
            0.588
          ],
          "content": "§ Each comparison or assignment is “1 step”"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.209,
            0.685,
            0.368,
            0.705
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Visualizing Sorting"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.739,
            0.201,
            0.753
          ],
          "content": "**Start:** b"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.129,
            0.822,
            0.202,
            0.837
          ],
          "content": "**In-Progress:** b"
