          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Algorithm “Complexity”"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.431,
            0.41,
            0.447
          ],
          "content": "• **Given**: a list of length n and a problem to solve"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.448,
            0.458,
            0.463
          ],
          "content": "• **Complexity**: rough number of steps to solve worst case"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.463,
            0.436,
            0.478
          ],
          "content": "• Suppose we can compute 1000 operations a second:"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.48,
            0.461,
            0.582
          ],
          "content": "| Complexity | n=10 | n=100 | n=1000 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| log n | 0.003 s | 0.006 s | 0.01 s |\n| n | 0.01 s | 0.1 s | 1 s |\n| nlog n | 0.016 s | 0.32 s | 4.79 s |\n| n<sup>2</sup> | 0.1 s | 10 s | 16.7 m |\n| n<sup>3</sup> | 1 s | 16.7 m | 11.6 d |\n| 2<sup>n</sup> | 1 s | 4x10<sup>19</sup> y | 3x10<sup>290</sup> y |",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_1_table_7.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.23,
            0.686,
            0.346,
            0.704
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Selection Sort"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.109,
            0.705,
            0.469,
            0.838
          ],
          "content": "",
