        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.185,
            0.842,
            0.392,
            0.86
          ],
          "content": "Remember the restrictions!"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.525,
            0.332,
            0.539,
            0.345
          ],
          "content": "8"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.596,
            0.124,
            0.826,
            0.142
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Insertion Sort: Performance"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.526,
            0.614,
            0.548,
            0.627
          ],
          "content": "10"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.715,
            0.154,
            0.849,
            0.17
          ],
          "content": "• b[0..i-1]: i elements"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.531,
            0.149,
            0.888,
            0.312
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_1_image_15.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.718,
            0.229,
            0.863,
            0.245
          ],
          "content": "• Pushdown is in a loop"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.641,
            0.405,
            0.781,
            0.424
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "A New Algorthm"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.525,
            0.417,
            0.896,
            0.607
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_1_image_18.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.631,
            0.554,
            0.736,
            0.578
          ],
          "content": "First segment always contains smaller values"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.623,
            0.686,
            0.799,
            0.704
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "What is the Problem?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.54,
            0.716,
            0.862,
            0.733
          ],
          "content": "• Both insertion, selection sort are **nested loops**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.558,
            0.735,
            0.793,
            0.75
          ],
          "content": "§ **Outer loop** over each element to sort"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.558,
            0.753,
            0.804,
            0.768
          ],
          "content": "§ **Inner loop** to put next element in place"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.558,
            0.77,
            0.758,
            0.785
          ],
          "content": "§ Each loop is n steps. n×n = n<sup>2</sup>"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.54,
            0.789,
            0.81,
            0.806
          ],
          "content": "• To do better we must eliminate a loop"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.558,
            0.808,
            0.715,
            0.824
          ],
          "content": "§ But how do we do that?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.558,
            0.825,
            0.766,
            0.842
          ],
          "content": "§ What is like a loop? **Recursion!**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.558,
            0.843,
            0.781,
            0.86
          ],
          "content": "§ Will see how to do this next lecture"
        },
        {
